{"question_id":"VAL-DB-05","course":"数据库原理","question":"按栖砾器材周转点的课堂口径，借用单 L301 应收多少周转费？请列出计费日期。","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"应收 18 元。借用单已归还且已签收，领出首日 9 月 23 日免费，全部收回日 9 月 26 日不计费，计费日为 9 月 24 日和 25 日。按借用档案的 3 件，每件每天 3 元，共 3×2×3 元。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"DB-03","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","start":2,"end":2}},{"doc_id":"DB-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":9,"end":9}},{"doc_id":"DB-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":15,"end":15}}]}
{"question_id":"VAL-DB-06","course":"数据库原理","question":"《数据库原理》实验二原本获得 30 分，若平台在截止后 25 小时才记录成功提交，扣分后应记多少分？","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"24.4 分。实验二满分 35，迟交超过 24 小时且不超过 48 小时扣原始满分的 16%，即扣 5.6 分，再从实际得分 30 分中减去。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"DB-01","locator":{"type":"docx_paragraph","start":11,"end":11}},{"doc_id":"DB-05","locator":{"type":"docx_paragraph","start":9,"end":9}}]}
