{"question_id":"VAL-NET-05","course":"计算机网络","question":"隙岚展运站 S1 的 M091 轮次，按课堂口径算出的往返时延中位数是多少？这轮分别触发延迟告警或可达性告警吗？","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"中位数是 44.5 毫秒，即 (44+45)/2。低于 45 毫秒的延迟门槛，且仅有 1 次无应答，低于 2 次的可达性门槛，所以两项告警均不触发。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"NET-03","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","start":2,"end":2}},{"doc_id":"NET-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":17,"end":17}}]}
{"question_id":"VAL-NET-06","course":"计算机网络","question":"《计算机网络》期末笔试卷面得了 64 分，折算后对课程总评贡献多少分？","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"贡献 35.2 分。卷面满分 80，64÷80×100 得到百分制 80 分，再按 44% 权重计入总评。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"NET-08","locator":{"type":"docx_paragraph","start":3,"end":3}},{"doc_id":"NET-01","locator":{"type":"docx_paragraph","start":6,"end":6}}]}
