{"question_id":"VAL-PY-05","course":"Python 程序设计","question":"LL-IN17 两条编号相同的 L602 都符合字段要求时，LL-B17 应保留第几行？该行的柜位和件数是什么？","answerable":true,"knowledge_type":"institutional","difficulty":"paraphrase_multi","gold_answer":"保留第 2 行，柜位 C08、7 件。同一编号保留第一条有效记录，因此第 7 行的重复记录不保留。","gold_sources":[{"doc_id":"PY-03","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","start":2,"end":2}},{"doc_id":"PY-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":9,"end":9}},{"doc_id":"PY-06","locator":{"type":"txt_line","start":17,"end":17}}]}
